      "content": "Wait, if you don't have access to the memos, how can you be so certain there aren't any mentions of the neurological side effects? You're telling me it's strictly stability and volatility stuff? \n\nJust to be 100% sure before I sign off on this—was there nothing in the technical descriptions of the ingredient's interaction that even hinted at biological pathways, or is it truly just pure chemistry?",
